igh damage with normal attacks."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","满满使用普通攻击时，有2%的几率造成1000% ATK伤害。该伤害不会暴击，且每场战斗最多触发1次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Chippy's normal attacks have a 2% chance to deal 1000% ATK damage. These attacks cannot deal critical damage and can only be triggered 1 time per battle."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":49,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","几率提升至3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the chance to 3%."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","几率提升至4%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the chance to 4%."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","几率提升至5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the chance to 5%."]]}